==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Galarian form]] of {{p|Ponyta}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Galarian Ponyta|81}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*'''Flop''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Magikarp|47}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

